---
/**
 * @fileoverview Development Tools Integration
 *
 * Astro component that integrates React Scan development tools for performance
 * monitoring and debugging React components during development. Only enabled
 * in development environment to avoid impacting production performance.
 *
 * Features:
 * - React component performance scanning
 * - Development-only activation
 * - Performance monitoring and optimization insights
 * - Component render analysis
 * - Development workflow enhancement
 *
 * Development Tools:
 * - React Scan for component performance analysis
 * - Render tracking and optimization suggestions
 * - Development environment detection
 * - Zero impact on production builds
 *
 * Usage:
 * - Automatically imported in layout files during development
 * - Provides visual feedback on component performance
 * - Helps identify rendering bottlenecks
 * - Assists in React optimization efforts
 *
 * Configuration:
 * - Enabled only when import.meta.env.DEV is true
 * - No configuration needed for basic usage
 * - Automatic detection of development mode
 *
 * @author SNGR Creative
 * @version 1.0.0
 */
---

<script>
  import { scan } from 'react-scan'

  scan({
    enabled: import.meta.env.DEV
  })
</script>
